{"events":[{"tStartMs":0,"dDurationMs":12300,"segs":[{"utf8":"Three desk lamps turned up this month, one of them is going straight back to the shop, and the cheapest one is the one I ended up keeping on my own desk."}]},{"tStartMs":12300,"dDurationMs":6900,"segs":[{"utf8":"Before any of that, a quick warning that two of these ship with a power brick that hums."}]},{"tStartMs":19200,"dDurationMs":11500,"segs":[{"utf8":"The first lamp arrived in a box roughly four times the size it needed to be, which tells you something about how it was designed to look on a shelf."}]},{"tStartMs":30700,"dDurationMs":10800,"segs":[{"utf8":"Build quality is better than the price suggests though, the arm is aluminium rather than painted steel, and it holds its position without drifting down over an afternoon."}]},{"tStartMs":41500,"dDurationMs":11500,"segs":[{"utf8":"Colour temperature runs from a warm twenty seven hundred kelvin up to something close to daylight, and the transition is smooth rather than the three fixed steps you often get."}]},{"tStartMs":53000,"dDurationMs":11200,"segs":[{"utf8":"I measured the draw at the wall with a cheap meter and it sat just under twelve watts at full brightness, which matches what the box claims for once."}]},{"tStartMs":64200,"dDurationMs":11500,"segs":[{"utf8":"The diffuser is the weak point, it is a thin sheet of frosted plastic and you can see the individual emitters through it if you sit low and look up."}]},{"tStartMs":75700,"dDurationMs":10000,"segs":[{"utf8":"For reading that does not matter at all, but if you film anything on this desk the pattern shows up in reflections on a laptop lid."}]},{"tStartMs":85700,"dDurationMs":11500,"segs":[{"utf8":"The second lamp has a much nicer finish, a proper anodised body, and a base heavy enough that you can move the head with one hand without holding the base."}]},{"tStartMs":97200,"dDurationMs":11500,"segs":[{"utf8":"Then they put the dimmer switch behind the head, so you reach over the light every single time you want to change it, and after a week that gets old."}]},{"tStartMs":108700,"dDurationMs":11900,"segs":[{"utf8":"After two weeks on my desk the coating near the hinge had already started to mark where my hand rests, which on a lamp at this price is hard to forgive."}]},{"tStartMs":120600,"dDurationMs":12300,"segs":[{"utf8":"The third lamp is the cheapest of the three by a wide margin and it is the one that is still on my desk now that the other two are boxed up."}]},{"tStartMs":132900,"dDurationMs":11900,"segs":[{"utf8":"It does exactly one thing, it points a flat even light at whatever is on the desk, and the arm has not sagged once in the month I have had it."}]},{"tStartMs":144800,"dDurationMs":11200,"segs":[{"utf8":"There is no app, no colour modes, and no memory of your last brightness, which sounds like a list of missing features until you use it for a week."}]},{"tStartMs":156000,"dDurationMs":11500,"segs":[{"utf8":"If you want numbers, it puts about four hundred lux on the page at forty centimetres, which is more than either of the expensive ones managed at the same distance."}]},{"tStartMs":167500,"dDurationMs":10400,"segs":[{"utf8":"The only real complaint is the cable, which is stiff enough to push the base around until you clip it down to the back of the desk."}]},{"tStartMs":177900,"dDurationMs":12700,"segs":[{"utf8":"Before the last section, this video is brought to you by Nordpass, which is the password manager I have been using since the last time I locked myself out of my own site."}]},{"tStartMs":190600,"dDurationMs":12300,"segs":[{"utf8":"It sits in the browser and on my phone, it fills logins in without me thinking about it, and I stopped keeping the important ones written on a card in a drawer."}]},{"tStartMs":202900,"dDurationMs":13100,"segs":[{"utf8":"The part that actually sold me is the shared vault, because my partner and I were emailing each other the wifi password roughly once a quarter like it was still two thousand and nine."}]},{"tStartMs":216000,"dDurationMs":13800,"segs":[{"utf8":"Go to nordpass dot com slash lamps and use code LAMPS20 at checkout for twenty percent off the two year plan, and there is a thirty day money back window if it is not for you."}]},{"tStartMs":229800,"dDurationMs":10400,"segs":[{"utf8":"That link is in the description below, it is the same one for every video, and using it is what pays for the lamps that go back."}]},{"tStartMs":240200,"dDurationMs":2000,"segs":[{"utf8":"Right, back to the desk."}]},{"tStartMs":242200,"dDurationMs":11200,"segs":[{"utf8":"One thing I did not expect is how much the finish of the desk changes the result, a gloss top throws the light straight back up into your eyes."}]},{"tStartMs":253400,"dDurationMs":10400,"segs":[{"utf8":"On a matte surface all three lamps looked a grade better, and the cheap one gained the most, because its diffuser problem stops mattering once nothing reflects."}]},{"tStartMs":263800,"dDurationMs":10800,"segs":[{"utf8":"I also tried all three on an arm clamp instead of the supplied base, and only the second one balanced properly, the other two needed the extra weight."}]},{"tStartMs":274600,"dDurationMs":11500,"segs":[{"utf8":"If you are buying one of these to light a keyboard for a stream, none of them is the right tool, you want a bar light above the monitor instead."}]},{"tStartMs":286100,"dDurationMs":11200,"segs":[{"utf8":"For a desk you actually work at, the answer is the cheap one, and the money you save covers a second one for the other end of the room."}]},{"tStartMs":297300,"dDurationMs":13500,"segs":[{"utf8":"So to run all of that back, the first lamp is overbuilt and has a diffuser problem, the second has the best body and the worst switch placement of anything I have tested this year."}]},{"tStartMs":310800,"dDurationMs":5000,"segs":[{"utf8":"The third is the one I would buy again without thinking about it."}]},{"tStartMs":315800,"dDurationMs":11500,"segs":[{"utf8":"If this was useful, the full desk setup with the arm, the mat and the cable clips is written up on my Patreon, and the links are below as always."}]},{"tStartMs":327300,"dDurationMs":10800,"segs":[{"utf8":"Hit subscribe so the follow up in six months actually shows up for you, because the thing I want to know is which of these survives a year."}]},{"tStartMs":338100,"dDurationMs":3800,"segs":[{"utf8":"Thanks for watching, and I will see you next week."}]}]}